.. tab-item:: Other APIs

     :ref:`AMPL APIs <apis>` give access to AMPL from a programming language:

     - `Python <https://ampl.com/api/latest/python>`_
     - `R <https://ampl.com/api/latest/R>`_
     - `C++ <https://ampl.com/api/latest/cpp>`_
     - `C#/.NET <https://ampl.com/api/latest/dotnet>`_
     - `C <https://ampl.com/api/latest/c>`_
     - `Java <https://ampl.com/api/latest/java>`_
     - `MATLAB <https://ampl.com/api/latest/matlab>`_

     :ref:`AMPLS <apis_ampls>` (AMPL solver libraries) load an AMPL model
     into the solver in C++ or Python and give direct access to the solver's
     own API, for example for callbacks. Python packages: ``amplpy-gurobi``,
     ``amplpy-cplex``, ``amplpy-xpress``, ``amplpy-copt``.
